# Eastron SDM530-MT.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Eastron SDM530-MT — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: eastron-sdm530mt-manual-protocol.pdf (SDM530-MT Modbus Protocol)
# | - 3-phase 4-wire multifunction meter with neutral current, RS485 Modbus RTU.
# | - Input registers FC04; protocol address = hex column value (= 3xxxx − 30001).
# | - IEEE 754 float32, Big-Endian (MSW first, no word_order needed).
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=9600, 8N1.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Eastron
@model=SDM530-MT
@vendor_website=eastroneurope.com
@description=3-phase 4-wire multifunction meter — per-phase V/I/P/Q/S/PF, phase angles, averages, totals, demands, neutral current, energy (IEEE 754 float32, FC04, Big-Endian).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/eastron-sdm530mt.toml; Source: eastron-sdm530mt-manual-protocol.pdf (SDM530-MT Modbus Protocol). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

